"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>戶反，戶反族</h1><p>便雅憫人，也是戶反族的祖先（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Num26:39\">民26:39</a>）；他可能與戶平（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen46:21\">創46:21</a>；<a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Chr7:12,1Chr7:15\">代上7:12、15</a>，又譯戶品）和戶蘭（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Chr8:5\">代上8:5</a>）是同一人。</p><p><em>另見</em> <span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"5116\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">戶平</span>；<span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"5119\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">戶蘭#1</span>。</p>",
